Today is Monday morning.
I am in the office.
Suresh is our manager.
He has called me and Rohan to his desk.
We go to his desk.
"Hello Suresh, how are you?" I ask.
"I am fine, Maya," Suresh says.
"Maya, welcome to the new core team," he says.
"Thank you, Suresh," I reply.
Suresh shows us a new project on the computer.
"The client has given us a big task," Suresh explains.
"This is a new software project."
"They have written their requirements in an email."
Suresh sends us that email.
"I have also added some more information to it," he says.
Rohan and I read the information.
"Have you both understood it?" Suresh asks.
"Yes Suresh, I have read the whole email," I say.
As a software engineer, this is my first big project here.
I am very excited about this new task.
